    {
      "id": "ledger-entry-posted",
      "name": "Ledger entry posted",
      "description": "strata_kernel::EventBody::LedgerEntryPosted: an entry was recorded in an account. Recorded in the commit of the entry and published from the outbox after it (RUN-005), so a trigger can subscribe to it (SCH-004). The owner is personal data and is never logged.",
