      "subject": "identity-service",
      "initial": "fedp-open",
      "description": "A sign-in attempt for an address. When the realm binds the email domain of the address to an identity provider, password and emailed-link sign-in are refused for it and only the provider sign-in is allowed.",
      "states": [
        {
          "id": "fedp-open",
          "name": "Deciding"
