    {"id":"mail-first-submission-lost","name":"The first submission is lost","description":"The mail provider does not take the first submission; the dispatcher times out at tick 3 and submits it again with the same key.","behaviors":["mail-dispatch-flow","mail-adapter-flow"],"faults":["first-submission-lost"],"steps":[
