      "retention": "Until the account of the person is removed or the tenant file is deleted. Removing the account, through the SCIM delete or any other removal of every login of a person, removes the rows of that person in the same operation (Store::remove_principal); a deactivated account keeps them, and no sign-in method accepts them for it. Erasing a subject (the contract erase-subject) removes them through Store::remove_principal, in the same erasure as the records of the subject.",
