          "description": "The whole schedule as canonical JSON: its rule, its anchor, whether it is paused, the due time of its next job and the counters created, completions and created-at-pause of schedule-flow-impl (SCH-003, SCH-005)."
        }
      ],
      "retention": "Until the tenant file is deleted: a schedule is held until the tenant owner changes it; no operation removes one yet.",
      "erasure": {
        "point": "the deletion of the tenant file"
      },
      "description": "Table schedules of a tenant file: the recurring schedules of the automation worker (rec-schedule, SCH-1574), written by define-schedule and by the report that completes the job of a schedule, in the transaction that creates its next job."
    },
    {
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "realisation": "shipped",
