    {
      "id": "workflow-step",
      "description": "transition.rs update_record, one workflow of the object type: nothing when the update leaves its field as it was; otherwise the first transition from the old string state to the new one whose guard holds (no guard, or expr.rs holds: exactly Bool(true)) fires: its assignments are evaluated (in field id order) with record and old the stored record and new the candidate, then set (a null clears the field), and workflow:<id>:<transition> passes. No transition that fires is WorkflowViolation with a failed workflow:<id> check: \"<transition>: guard is not true\" or \"<transition>: <evaluation error>\" per refused transition joined with \"; \", or \"no transition from <old:?> to <new:?>\". An assignment that fails to evaluate is Evaluation \"<transition>: set <field>: <error>\". Guards and assignments follow a reference through the snapshot's lookup (rule-lookup over the stored record and the candidate); one that fails to evaluate because the snapshot does not cover a record it follows is InsufficientState naming that record (rule-missing, transition.rs missing_error; WG-5096).",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "d",
          "type": "draft"
        },
        {
          "name": "old",
          "type": "record"
        },
        {
          "name": "candidate",
          "type": "record"
        },
        {
          "name": "workflow",
          "type": "workflow-def"
        }
      ],
      "returns": "workflow-outcome",
      "errors": "rejection",
      "let": [
        {
          "name": "from",
          "expr": "match get(old.fields, workflow.field) { Some(y) => y, None => call null-value() }"
        },
        {
          "name": "to",
          "expr": "match get(candidate.fields, workflow.field) { Some(y) => y, None => call null-value() }"
        },
        {
          "name": "rule",
          "expr": "format('workflow:{}', workflow.id)"
        },
        {
          "name": "env",
          "expr": "expr-env{record: call record-scope(old), old: call record-scope(old), new: call record-scope(candidate), param: {}, now: value.time(d.ctx.now), principal: call principal-value(d.ctx.principal), has_role: call roles-of(d.tenant, d.ctx.principal)}"
        },
        {
          "name": "reach",
          "expr": "rule-reach{tenant: d.tenant, coverage: d.coverage, subject: subject{old: old, new: candidate}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "lookup",
          "expr": "call rule-lookup(reach)"
        }
      ],
      "body": "if from == to then workflow-outcome{draft: d, candidate} else let search = fold(t in workflow.transitions, s = workflow-search{refused: []}, if s.fired != null || from != value.str(t.from) || to != value.str(t.to) then s else match t.guard { None => workflow-search{fired: t, refused: s.refused}, Some(g) => match eval(tenant-rule-language, g, env, lookup) { Ok(r) => match r { bool(b) => if b then workflow-search{fired: t, refused: s.refused} else workflow-search{refused: concat(s.refused, [format('{}: guard is not true', t.name)])}, _ => workflow-search{refused: concat(s.refused, [format('{}: guard is not true', t.name)])} }, Err(e) => match call rule-missing(g, reach) { Some(n) => fail(rejection.rejected(call insufficient(n))), None => workflow-search{refused: concat(s.refused, [format('{}: {}', t.name, e)])} } } }) in match search.fired { None => let detail = if search.refused == [] then format('no transition from {} to {}', call value-debug(from), call value-debug(to)) else call join-semicolon(search.refused) in fail(call draft-reject(concat(d.evidence, [check{rule, passed: false, detail}]), error-kind.workflow-violation, detail)), Some(t) => let assigned = fold(k in keys(t.set), acc = {}, match get(t.set, k) { Some(e) => match eval(tenant-rule-language, e, env, lookup) { Ok(x) => insert(acc, k, x), Err(err) => match call rule-missing(e, reach) { Some(n) => fail(rejection.rejected(call insufficient(n))), None => fail(call draft-reject(d.evidence, error-kind.evaluation, format('{}: set {}: {}', t.name, k, err))) } }, None => acc }) in workflow-outcome{draft: draft{tenant: d.tenant, ctx: d.ctx, coverage: d.coverage, ops: d.ops, events: d.events, effects: d.effects, evidence: concat(d.evidence, [check{rule: format('{}:{}', rule, t.name), passed: true, detail: format('{} -> {}', t.from, t.to)}]), next-record: d.next-record}, candidate: record{id: candidate.id, object: candidate.object, version: candidate.version, created-by: candidate.created-by, created-at: candidate.created-at, updated-at: candidate.updated-at, fields: fold(k in keys(assigned), m = candidate.fields, match get(assigned, k) { Some(x) => if call value-is-null(x) then remove(m, k) else insert(m, k, x), None => m })}} }",
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "behaviour.rs undeclared_status_changes_are_refused_from_every_state: a change that leaves the workflow field alone is not a workflow matter.",
          "args": {
            "d": {
              "fixture": "fx-draft-4",
              "with": {
                "ctx.now": 5007,
                "ctx.correlation": "test-5007"
              }
            },
            "old": {
              "id": 1,
              "object": "note",
              "version": 1,
              "created-by": "alpha:writer1",
              "created-at": 5000,
              "updated-at": 5000,
              "fields": {
                "slug": {
                  "str": "first"
                },
                "status": {
                  "str": "draft"
                },
                "title": {
                  "str": "First"
                }
              }
            },
            "candidate": {
              "id": 1,
              "object": "note",
              "version": 2,
              "created-by": "alpha:writer1",
              "created-at": 5000,
              "updated-at": 5007,
              "fields": {
                "slug": {
                  "str": "first"
                },
                "status": {
                  "str": "draft"
                },
                "title": {
                  "str": "First"
                },
                "body": {
                  "str": "one"
                }
              }
            },
            "workflow": {
              "fixture": "fx-workflow-def-2"
            }
          },
          "result": {
            "draft": {
              "tenant": {
                "id": "alpha",
                "name": "alpha",
                "revision": 6,
                "next-record": 2,
                "event-seq": 6,
                "schema": {
                  "version": 2,
                  "objects": {
                    "note": {
                      "id": "note",
                      "label": "Note",
                      "fields": {
                        "author": {
                          "id": "author",
                          "label": "Author",
                          "ty": {
                            "ref": {
                              "target": "person",
                              "on-delete": "set-null"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": false,
                          "unique": false
                        },
                        "body": {
                          "id": "body",
                          "label": "body",
                          "ty": "str",
                          "required": false,
                          "unique": false
                        },
                        "published_at": {
                          "id": "published_at",
                          "label": "published_at",
                          "ty": "time",
                          "required": false,
                          "unique": false
                        },
                        "rank": {
                          "id": "rank",
                          "label": "rank",
                          "ty": "int",
                          "required": false,
                          "unique": false
                        },
                        "slug": {
                          "id": "slug",
                          "label": "slug",
                          "ty": "str",
                          "required": true,
                          "unique": true
                        },
                        "status": {
                          "id": "status",
                          "label": "status",
                          "ty": "str",
                          "required": true,
                          "unique": false,
                          "default": {
                            "lit": {
                              "str": "draft"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "title": {
                          "id": "title",
                          "label": "title",
                          "ty": "str",
                          "required": true,
                          "unique": false
                        }
                      },
                      "constraints": {
                        "title_length": {
                          "id": "title_length",
                          "expr": {
                            "cmp": {
                              "op": "le",
                              "left": {
                                "len": {
                                  "var": {
                                    "scope": "new",
                                    "field": "title"
                                  }
                                }
                              },
                              "right": {
                                "lit": {
                                  "int": 24
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "message": "A title has at most 24 characters"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "person": {
                      "id": "person",
                      "label": "Person",
                      "fields": {
                        "name": {
                          "id": "name",
                          "label": "name",
                          "ty": "str",
                          "required": true,
                          "unique": false
                        }
                      },
                      "constraints": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "roles": {
                    "editor": {
                      "id": "editor",
                      "label": "Editor"
                    },
                    "owner": {
                      "id": "owner",
                      "label": "Owner"
                    },
                    "public": {
                      "id": "public",
                      "label": "Everyone"
                    },
                    "writer": {
                      "id": "writer",
                      "label": "Writer"
                    }
                  },
                  "policies": {
                    "editors_manage_notes": {
                      "id": "editors_manage_notes",
                      "role": "editor",
                      "resource": {
                        "object": "note"
                      },
                      "actions": [
                        "read",
                        "create",
                        "update",
                        "delete"
                      ],
                      "condition": null
                    },
                    "editors_manage_people": {
                      "id": "editors_manage_people",
