    },
    {
      "id": "kernel-plan-migration",
      "description": "crates/kernel/src/transition.rs plan_migration as contract plan-schema-migration (CT-007) takes it: plan-migration on a complete snapshot, with the printed constraints of the new schema (texts, an input of the contract until the function language can print an expression, WG-4957).",
      "params": [
