      "id": "schema-with-tables",
      "description": "The schema with its tables of mail templates, notice templates, tokens and installed products replaced; a table left empty is none, so a schema that holds none of them hashes as one that never did (D-7341).",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "schema",
